'''Sagat''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sagat
|image = E 531.png
|first appearance = [[Solitary Emperor (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has somewhat high health, but low DPS, and extremely low range, but this is balanced out by his powerful [[Omni Strike]], [[Wave Attack]], and his [[Strengthen|strengthen]] abilities.

==Strategy==
Dealing with this enemy's waves won't be like dealing with [[Kory]]'s waves, as Sagat has a very short attack animation. The use of [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|wave immune cats]] is recommended, otherwise units with good range and high health work quite well too.

